{62}{I'm looking for Erland Iron Heart. Do you know him?}{}{5}{lf1 0, qa1091 1}{10}{lf1 1}
{70}{You've got to go through the door in the back of the storage room off the main hall to get to the old tunnel that leads to it, but I'd be careful if you're planning on going there. [He hands you a key.]}{You've got to go through the door in the back of the storage room off the main hall to get to the old tunnel that leads to it, but I'd be careful if you're planning on going there. [He hands you a key.]}{}{}{}{lf3 1, in-4421}
